          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.542,
                0.297,
                0.61,
                0.315
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 5.7"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_23_image_0.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.33,
            0.881,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": "**Make one more horizontal fold in the folded sheet. How many parallel lines do you see now?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.374,
            0.881,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "**What will happen if you do it once more? How many parallel lines will you get? Is there a pattern? Check if the pattern extends further, if you make another horizontal fold.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.441,
            0.881,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": "**Make a vertical fold in the square sheet. This new vertical line** is to the previous horizontal lines."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.486,
            0.882,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "**Fold the sheet along a diagonal. Can you find a fold that creates a line parallel to the diagonal line?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.553,
            0.193,
            0.57
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.581,
            0.321,
            0.599
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Fill in the Blanks"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.604,
            0.741,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": "● The opposite edges of the sheet are **parallel** to each other."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.626,
            0.807,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": "● The adjacent edges of the sheet are **perpendicular** to each other."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.67,
            0.362,
            0.687
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "First Horizontal Fold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.689,
            0.881,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": "● We will see **three** parallel lines. The new line segment is **perpendicular** to the vertical sides."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.748,
            0.443,
            0.766
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Subsequent Horizontal Folds"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.768,
            0.881,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": "After one more horizontal fold, we will see a total of **five** parallel lines. The two original horizontal edges, the first fold line, and the second fold line are all parallel to each other."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.835,
            0.881,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": "● If we fold it horizontally one more time, we will get **nine** parallel lines. Yes, the pattern is $2 ^ { \\mathrm { n } } + 1$ , where n is the number of folds."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
